    .withFeatureTypes("QUERIES", "SIGNATURES")
    .withDocument(new Document()
        .withBytes(imageBytes))
    .withAdaptersConfig(new AdaptersConfig()
        .withAdapters(adapters));

AnalyzeDocumentResult result = client.analyzeDocument(request);
```

